{"asset_key":"timeline/quest_story_18107661","episode":"timeline","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18107661","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:0:1810762101:0":{"text":"セリスが解毒薬をレナードに渡した。だが、レナードはまだ迷っているようだ。","source_cn":"爱丝将解药交到了里纳手中。然而，里纳却似乎有些犹豫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6E5E3C54218FCA8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1810762102:1":{"text":"どうしたの？薬に何か問題でもあった？","source_cn":"怎么了？这瓶药有什么不对吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x700B78B3C1061D53","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1810762103:0":{"text":"い、いや……ただ……まだ、踏ん切りがつかなくて。","source_cn":"不……不是。我只是有点……犹豫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03AE6A7586BE86EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:6:1810762103":{"text":"い、いや……ただ……まだ、踏ん切りがつかなくて。","source_cn":"不……不是。我只是有点……犹豫。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x03AE6A7586BE86EE","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1810762104:0":{"text":"……記憶が戻ったら、セリスやセインがしたことを理解してしまいそうで、怖いんだ。","source_cn":"……我害怕恢复记忆以后，就会理解你和瑟恩所做的一切。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9867B90CD9EF2CF7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1810762105:0":{"text":"なんだか、それは……ばあちゃんに不公平な気がして……","source_cn":"可是这样……或许对穆婆婆不公平。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3E7D007E36FA8231","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1810762106:0":{"text":"お前の理解と許しを求めるつもりはない。あの時、お前を止めた時点で覚悟はしていた。","source_cn":"我不奢求你的理解和原谅。下定决心阻拦你的那一刻，我就已...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE3F7FD8F5EFD785B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1810762107:0":{"text":"……このまま飲まずに、「レナード」として生きていきたいなら、それでもかまわない。","source_cn":"你也可以拒绝恢复记忆，以“里纳”的身份继续活下去。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE4B57456786B16EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1810762108:1":{"text":"…………\n「バートン」は、そんなことしないって分かってるんだろ。","source_cn":"………………\\n你明知道“巴登”不会这样做。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC9D72C8AD238A2D4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1810762109:0":{"text":"お前がどちらを選ぼうと、私は責めない。この命ある限り、セリスとライアン家に仕えると誓ったからな。","source_cn":"无论你作何选择，我都不会有怨言。我已发誓守护爱丝和瑞恩...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x516A1B4F3F1764E6","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1810762110:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1810762111:0":{"text":"バートンさん……いえ、レナードさん。よければ、グレイヴボーンである私の考えを聞いてくれるかしら？","source_cn":"巴登先生……不，里纳先生。若你不介意，请听听我作为亡灵...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1B78D79AB13E0643","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1810762112:0":{"text":"詳しい経緯は分からないけれど、ムン婆がしたことは、きっと彼女自身が望み、決めたことだと思うの。自分を犠牲にしてあなたを救ったことも含めてね。","source_cn":"虽然不清楚事情的具体经过，但我想，穆婆婆所做的一切必定...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4C23C86BA8942DA7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1810762113:0":{"text":"彼女があなたをどれほど大切に思っていたか、修繕屋の客なら誰もが知っているわ。","source_cn":"毕竟她对你的爱护，每一位修缮屋的客人都有目共睹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x837FF8EBFBBA2DCF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1810762114:1":{"text":"だからこそ、俺は自分が許せないんだ……！","source_cn":"就是因为这样，我才无法原谅自己……！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA75BFDC342FBAAFC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1810762115:1":{"text":"あなたの痛みは理解できる。でも、ムン婆の命はここで終わったわけではないのよ。","source_cn":"我明白你的痛苦。但这不是生命的终点。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x387D53938AB0A775","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1810762116:1":{"text":"死が生者の終点ではないように、消滅もグレイヴボーンの終わりではない。<style=\"highlight\">本当の終わりは、忘れられることよ</style>。","source_cn":"就像死亡不是生者的终点，消散也不是亡灵的终点。<sty...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x666613B06C013092","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1810762117:1":{"text":"忘れられること……","source_cn":"遗忘……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5F7A4A3AAB1BA699","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1810762118:1":{"text":"ええ。私が演じる『消えゆく声』のように、あなたがムン婆を忘れなければ、彼女の魂と意志はいつまでも生き続ける。","source_cn":"是的。如同我所演出的《消逝之声》那样，只要你记得穆婆婆...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77B8B134F3258053","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1810762119:1":{"text":"あなたの命と人生は、ムン婆が全力で守ろうとした、何より大切なものよ。あなたが失意に沈んだままでは、彼女もきっと悲しむわ。","source_cn":"你的生命，你的人生，是她拼尽全力也要保护的最宝贵之物。...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9DD0EC65C26231AC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1810762120:1":{"text":"ムン婆の犠牲を無駄にしないで。過去を取り戻して、彼女への思いを胸に生きて。受け取った愛情を――生と死の隔たりさえ越えた絆を、もっと多くの人に伝えてあげて。","source_cn":"请不要辜负她的牺牲。找回属于你的过去，带着对她的思念活...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4F1B5CDB2F34CC6E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1810762121:1":{"text":"生と死を越えた、絆……","source_cn":"跨越生死……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD475DE7F0972BC30","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1810762122:1":{"text":"……分かった。","source_cn":"……我明白了。<key:dialog803>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x958508793A16C8F7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:31:1810763101:":{"text":"うっ……！","source_cn":"呃……！<key:dialog8016>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2A25E4A98FD29298","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:31:1810763102:":{"text":"バートン！","source_cn":"巴登！<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB63726CD6A415135","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:35:1810764101:1":{"text":"お……思い出した……","source_cn":"我……我的记忆……我想起来了……<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5900424F14BBB7DA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:36:1810764102:0":{"text":"あぁ……兄さんっ！","source_cn":"呜呜呜……巴登！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2F10982E36DB6F70","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:37:1810764103:0":{"text":"……本当に、思い出したんだな。","source_cn":"……想起来就好。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4A366B7C91645427","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:38:1810764104:0":{"text":"ほら、セリス……一族の当主がいつまでも泣きべそをかいてちゃだめじゃないか。","source_cn":"好啦，爱丝……你现在可是家主，不能再哭鼻子了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC722CB5E5E53E1E7","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:41:1810764105:0":{"text":"それにセインも。顔をしかめてないで、少しは喜んでくれよ。","source_cn":"还有瑟恩，你不应该更高兴吗？笑一笑吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9E99B3573A7E021D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:42:1810764106:0":{"text":"……無理に笑わなくてもいい。","source_cn":"……你不必这样强颜欢笑。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x44DE5247598FF46A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:43:1810764107:0":{"text":"……","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:44:1810764108:0":{"text":"ムン婆のことは……本当にすまなかった。だが私は、ああするしかなかったのだ。","source_cn":"穆婆婆的事……对不起。那是我必须做的选择。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE085D1BA5F959F3A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:45:1810764109:1":{"text":"……ああ、分かっているよ。","source_cn":"……嗯，我知道。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDD2944543751FE2C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:46:1810764110:0":{"text":"ありがとう、セイン。セリスを支え、こうして俺を探し、何度も身を挺して助けてくれて……君は俺のために、十分すぎるほどのことをしてくれた。だから、もう自分を責めないでくれ。","source_cn":"谢谢你，瑟恩。培养爱丝、寻找我、一次次舍身救我……你已...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x5C1594582819F5A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:47:1810764111:0":{"text":"俺は君を責めたりしない。恨むなんてもってのほかだ。\nただ今は……少し、悲しいだけだ。","source_cn":"我不会责怪你，更不会恨你。\\n只是我现在……有点悲伤。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4B31024BAAEEC5FB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:48:1810764112:0":{"text":"バートン……","source_cn":"巴登……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8F18279B6D894431","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:49:1810764113:0":{"text":"バンティスと戦ってきた俺たちは、グレイヴボーンはみな冷酷なモンスターだと思っていた。けれど……ばあちゃんは俺を助けるために自ら犠牲になった……","source_cn":"我们一直与班题斯为敌，总觉得亡灵全是毫无人性的怪物。可...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8CA52F6FD9647C8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:50:1810764114:1":{"text":"バヤチェ先生の記憶の影響があったとはいえ……「レナード」として生きていた時も、あの人が俺に向けてくれた優しさは本物だった。","source_cn":"虽然她的确受到了巴亚茄老师记忆的影响……但在我以“里纳...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3BFF534D97E019FC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:51:1810764115:1":{"text":"ばあちゃんはグレイヴボーンで、俺が人間だと知っていたのに……だから今は、もう会えないことが、すごく辛いんだ……","source_cn":"她是亡灵，也知道我是生者……而我现在，正在为她的离开而痛苦。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC41E7A1CEEDAA67C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:52:1810764116:1":{"text":"俺は……","source_cn":"我……<key:dialog858>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA388BF99B2CD5A83","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:53:1810764117:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"………………","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x197F0BE8A09E0D34","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:54:1810764118:1":{"text":"私たちの教官の言葉を覚えているか。「誰かが倒れた時――」","source_cn":"你还记得我们教官常说的话吧？“有人倒下后——”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBE097DFB081A1229","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:55:1810764119:1":{"text":"「――私たちは、その者が歩めなかった道を歩んでいく」","source_cn":"“——我们便是他的未竟之路。”","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x738768732D4174E0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:56:1810764120:1":{"text":"……だから、お前は生きるんだ。彼女の犠牲を無駄にしないためにも。","source_cn":"所以，你好好活着，就不负她的牺牲。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB16603ED2EC6E86B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:57:1810764121:0":{"text":"……そうだな。","source_cn":"……嗯。<key:dialog808>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA83B645BB6A5DBAD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:58:1810764122:0":{"text":"そういえば、君たち二人ともノヴァリスに来て大丈夫なのか？テフラスキアの戦況は？今は誰が国境を守っているんだ？","source_cn":"对了，为什么你和爱丝都跑到诺珐斯来了？灰影郡战况如何？...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECFAFF227F6BF556","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:61:1810764123:0":{"text":"ごめんなさい。セインが出て行ったあと、私、いてもたってもいられなくなって……","source_cn":"对不起。瑟恩离开后，我实在没法安心待在灰影郡干等着。<...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x42AB1C2B2DC0C18E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:62:1810764124:0":{"text":"だから……独断で領地を離れたの。でも、思いつく限りのことはやったわ。","source_cn":"所以……我就擅自离岗了。但你不用担心，我把能想到的事情...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x97E237D4EA37395B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:63:1810764125:0":{"text":"セリスはバートンに、自分が行った対策を話した。","source_cn":"爱丝特瑞达向巴登简单叙述了一遍她的安排。<key:di...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC988A36AC084E5B3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:64:1810764126:1":{"text":"偉いぞ、セリス。ずいぶん頼もしくなったな。さすがはライアン家の当主だ。","source_cn":"干得好，爱丝……你比以前稳重了很多。不愧是我们瑞恩家族...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB864BAAF3FF7CC9E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:65:1810764127:1":{"text":"でも、独断で持ち場を離れるなんて、当主失格よ。","source_cn":"巴登，我擅离职守，不配再为家主，理应受罚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E1956B82D517C18","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:66:1810764128:1":{"text":"テフラスキアに戻ったら、あなたが当主として私に処罰を下して。","source_cn":"等你回到灰影郡后，以家主的身份处置我吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1C6CFB30BA04723A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:67:1810764129:1":{"text":"いや……<style=\"highlight\">まだ、テフラスキアには戻らない</style>。","source_cn":"不，爱丝……<style=highlight>我暂时不...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0652B54B260E0E7A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:68:1810764130:1":{"text":"えっ！？どういうこと？","source_cn":"那你要去哪里？！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA8559F8251943F8A","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:69:1810764131:1":{"text":"幽声諸島の様子を見に行きたいんだ。","source_cn":"去幽声群岛，看看那里的情况。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFB4A97F44A5A1F8D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:70:1810764132:1":{"text":"ばあちゃんの腕がバヤチェ先生のものだったということは、向こうの戦況は相当切迫しているはずだ……放っておくわけにはいかない。","source_cn":"巴亚茄老师的肢体被穆婆婆所继承，说明幽声群岛的战况不容...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD6615AD7BD8C70A1","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:71:1810764133:0":{"text":"でも、記憶が戻ったばかりなのよ。せめて……せめて一度テフラスキアに戻ってから……","source_cn":"可是你才刚找回记忆！至少……至少也该回灰影郡看看……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x20CAE50921BD16EA","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:72:1810764134:0":{"text":"ふふふっ……","source_cn":"咳……呵呵呵……<key:dialog1>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x19867A66BF22B520","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:75:1810764135:0":{"text":"軽やかな笑い声と共に、テペシュがあなたの隣に姿を現した。","source_cn":"伴随着轻快的笑声，苔佩希的身影忽然出现在了你身边。<k...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x36016168AD06ECA9","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"軽やかな笑い声と共に、テペシュがあなたの隣に姿を現した。","female":"軽やかな笑い声と共に、テペシュがあなたの隣に姿を現した。","variant_male_record_index":"243358","variant_female_record_index":"243359","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:76:1810764136:0":{"text":"甘いわね、お嬢さん。幽声諸島の現状は、あなたたちが思っているよりずっと悲惨よ。","source_cn":"瑞恩小姐，你太天真了。幽声群岛的现状比你们的预估更为可怕。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xCD49AB88618DA463","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:77:1810764137:0":{"text":"妾の使者が持ってきた、バンティスの情報を見せてあげるわ。","source_cn":"来吧，让余的信使给你们看看班题斯的情报。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xE640BA95DCFB4A7E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"cinematic_dialogue:80:1810765001:":{"text":"これよ。","source_cn":"就是这份文件","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA6A8E718D17E8DAB","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"document:81:614:0":{"text":"…………\nホジキン率いる死海の艦隊（モルティア）は、ブライト王国領のラスティーアンカーで壊滅したとの情報あり。バンティスが紛失した法具は、一人のメイジの手に渡った模様。身元はなお不明。\n死海の艦隊を追跡していた軍の船団は、すでに進路を変更。バンティスはラスティーアンカーを征服対象には指定していない。\n…………\nバンティス軍の船団はブライト王国辺境の幽声諸島に到達し、現地軍の支援に入った。諸島の先住民は劣勢。\n…………\nブライト王国領・幽声諸島では、すでに島々の三分の二がバンティス軍に占領された。\nトーランの最新命令：幽声諸島駐留兵力の半数をバンティス領内へ帰還させ、再編後、北方戦線へ投入せよ。\n…………\nブライト王国テフラスキア周辺のバンティス軍駐屯地三か所が壊滅。\nトーランは兵員の確認と物資の準備を命じ、部隊を再編してテフラスキアへ増援として派遣するよう指示した。\nバンティス国境では十数か所で戦闘が続いており、戦力が逼迫していることから、今回の増援には少なくとも三か月を要すると見込まれる。\n…………\nグリーズル率いる軍は、使者を早馬でバンティス国都へ送り返し、ノヴァリスの近況を報告させようとしている。阻止のため、すでに人員を派遣済み。\nなお、グリーズルの生死は現時点で不明。","source_cn":"………………\n传闻霍德希金所率领的死潮舰队已于耀光帝国锈锚港覆灭，班题斯遗失之圣器落入一魔法师手中，其身份尚不明确。\n追踪死潮舰队的军方船队已转向。班题斯并没有将锈锚港列为应征服地区。\n………………\n班题斯军方船队已抵达耀光帝国边陲的幽声群岛，支援此地军队。群岛土著居民落入下风。\n………………\n耀光帝国幽声群岛三分之二岛屿已被班题斯军队占领。\n托安最新命令：调遣幽声群岛一半军力返回班题斯境内，待修整后投入北面战场。\n………………\n三个位于耀光帝国灰影郡周边的班题斯军营已被捣毁。\n托安已下令清点士兵、筹备物资，整军派往灰影郡增援。\n考虑到班题斯边境存在十余处战场，战力吃紧，预估此次增援行动至少需要三月时间。\n………………\n格瑞泽尔勒所率领军队已命信使快马返回班题斯国都，呈报诺珐斯近况。已派人前往阻截。\n另，格瑞泽尔勒生死暂不明确。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xB9E2A5CEB4944A7D","variant_status":"","male":"…………\nホジキン率いる死海の艦隊（モルティア）は、ブライト王国領のラスティーアンカーで壊滅したとの情報あり。バンティスが紛失した法具は、一人のメイジの手に渡った模様。身元はなお不明。\n死海の艦隊を追跡していた軍の船団は、すでに進路を変更。バンティスはラスティーアンカーを征服対象には指定していない。\n…………\nバンティス軍の船団はブライト王国辺境の幽声諸島に到達し、現地軍の支援に入った。諸島の先住民は劣勢。\n…………\nブライト王国領・幽声諸島では、すでに島々の三分の二がバンティス軍に占領された。\nトーランの最新命令：幽声諸島駐留兵力の半数をバンティス領内へ帰還させ、再編後、北方戦線へ投入せよ。\n…………\nブライト王国テフラスキア周辺のバンティス軍駐屯地三か所が壊滅。\nトーランは兵員の確認と物資の準備を命じ、部隊を再編してテフラスキアへ増援として派遣するよう指示した。\nバンティス国境では十数か所で戦闘が続いており、戦力が逼迫していることから、今回の増援には少なくとも三か月を要すると見込まれる。\n…………\nグリーズル率いる軍は、使者を早馬でバンティス国都へ送り返し、ノヴァリスの近況を報告させようとしている。阻止のため、すでに人員を派遣済み。\nなお、グリーズルの生死は